-- Same-named-type bystander, half of the L1 step-2b repro (sprint/ctor-identity,
-- S-ctor-oracle-identity-family). `T` here is NEVER the scrutinee's type in
-- main.mdk -- it exists only to give the oracle a same-named, wrong-arity row to
-- collide with, at column 0 of a `match`.
public export data T = A | B
